      "created_at": "2019-01-05T02:53:20Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-01-05T02:53:20Z",
      "body": "> The thought of accidentally pushing to a GitHub remote is horrifying.\r\n\r\n@rgayler If this is a concern, it seems that the simplest option would be to remove the GitHub remote, and at that point `wflow_git_push` should no longer work. For more details, run `git remote  --help`.",
